<header><p class="st-kicker">other · Greece and the Aegean</p><h1 class="st-title">Ionian League</h1><p class="st-meta">700 BCE – 494 BCE (approx.) · capital Panionion</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Religious and political union of twelve Ionian cities on the coast of Anatolia, centred on the Panionion, which led the Ionian Revolt against Persia.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The twelve cities were <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/miletus">Miletus</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/myus">Myus</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/priene">Priene</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/ephesus">Ephesus</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/colophon">Colophon</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/lebedos">Lebedos</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/teos">Teos</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/clazomenae">Clazomenae</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/phocaea">Phocaea</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/samos">Samos</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/chios">Chios</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/erythrae">Erythrae</a>; <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/smyrna">Smyrna</a> joined later. They formed the league c. 700 BCE, after destroying the city of Melia, whose land became the site of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panionium">Panionion</a>, a shrine of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poseidon">Poseidon</a> Helikonios on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mount-mycale">Mount Mycale</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The league held the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panionium">Panionia</a> festival and met to discuss common affairs, but the cities stayed independent and often fought each other. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thales-of-miletus">Thales</a> proposed a single council at <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/teos">Teos</a>, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bias-of-priene">Bias of Priene</a> urged mass emigration to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sardinia">Sardinia</a> when <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a> attacked c. 545 BCE; neither advice was followed. The cities fell to the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/kingdom-of-lydia">Kingdom of Lydia</a> and the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/achaemenid-empire">Achaemenid Empire</a>.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>Delegates met at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panionium">Panionion</a> to coordinate the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ionian-revolt">Ionian Revolt</a> of 499 BCE, which ended with defeat at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lade">Lade</a> and the sack of <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/miletus">Miletus</a> in 494 BCE. The league survived later only as a religious association.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/ionian-league.jpg" alt="Ionian League" width="320" height="157"><figcaption>Image: Reinhard Saczewski · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kolophon_-_M%C3%BCnzkabinett,_Berlin_-_5476346.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>700 BCE – 494 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/8th-century-bce">8th century BCE</a> – <a href="/centuries/5th-century-bce">5th century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>other</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>mercantile</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Panionion</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Greek religion; cult of Poseidon Helikonios</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Ionic Greek</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/turkey">Turkey</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Panionion, Ionian Dodecapolis</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-597&amp;focus=ionian-league" aria-label="Ionian League on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5540 752 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Ionian League lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5682 1083h0M5682 1079h0M5668 1061h0M5664 1046h0M5647 1055h0M6140 1251h0M5685 1081h0M5672 1065h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5860 1008h0"/><path class="map-dot-ap" d="M5860 1008h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>Location app